_KEY2 = [("1. What is the season in Japan at the time the post was written?", "Winter."), ("2. What is exciting about spring?", "The blooming of the cherry blossoms."), ("3. What did Marynol remember about fall?", "She was amazed by the colorful trees."), ("4. What two severe weather conditions were mentioned?", "Typhoon or storm and flooding."), ("5. What did Marynol miss in the Philippines and why?", "She misses summer because she is always at the beach.")]
