        card("Activity 8, speaker 1: the rainy season (the book’s script)", "Key (Tagalog terms and an activity): malakas ang ulan, bumabaha, umaambon, umuulan, malamig na panahon, baha; activities: bathing outside in the rain; eating fried rice, dried fish, chocolate porridge and arroz caldo; sleeping.", examples=passage(_S1)),
